      "title": "BOOK TALK: The Ragged Edge of Freedom: Race, Capitalism, and Class Struggle in Slavery’s Borderland",
      "url": "https://housmans.com/event/book-talk-the-ragged-edge-of-freedom-race-capitalism-and-class-struggle-in-slaverys-borderland/",
